# Quina, Qu Gourmet: "If one or more tokens would be created under your control, those tokens plus a 1/1 green Frog
# creature token are created instead." On turn 2 Bot2 makes two Goblins with Frontline Rush: they are not Bot1's, so
# neither player gets a Frog. On turn 3 Quina attacks, and Gut, True Soul Zealot's trigger sacrifices a Mox to create a
# 4/1 Skeleton that's tapped and attacking: Quina adds one Frog, and it too is created tapped and attacking (ruling
# 2025-06-06), so Bot2 takes 2 + 4 + 1.

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Black Lotus
Quina, Qu Gourmet
Gut, True Soul Zealot
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Mountain x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Frontline Rush
Island x12

[Actions]
